  "description": "Wu-Ju’s first meeting with Do-Yeong ended in anger. Their reunion came with fear. And suddenly living under the same roof? Total chaos. But with Do-Yeong barging into his life so boldly and shamelessly, Wu-Ju’s carefully guarded world - built on worrying about others’ opinions and pining after his hopeless crush, Hyeon-Wu- starts to crumble in the most unexpected ways. And before he knows it, Wu-Ju just might be falling for the very storm that turned his life upside down…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
